        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Yea, I will make many people amazed at thee, and their kings shall be horribly afraid for thee, when I shall brandish my sword before them; and they shall tremble at every moment, every man for his own life, in the day of thy fall.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 166,
            "end": 171
