        "book": "Ezekiel",
        "chapter": 32,
        "verse": 15
      },
      {
        "text": "This is the lamentation wherewith they shall lament her: the daughters of the nations shall lament her: they shall lament for her, even for Egypt, and for all her multitude, saith the Lord God.",
